</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[VF101 Interlock Summary — Sets Device[5].Interlock while any VF101 VFD interlock cause is active.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(VF101.VFDCommsIntlk) ,XIC(VF101.VFDFaultIntlk) ]OTE(Device[5].Interlock);]]>
</Text>
