<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(EstopActive)[XIC(VF101.VFDCommsIntlk) MOV(20,Device[5].InterlockID) ,XIO(VF101.VFDCommsIntlk) XIC(VF101.VFDFaultIntlk) MOV(21,Device[5].InterlockID) ,XIO(VF101.VFDCommsIntlk) XIO(VF101.VFDFaultIntlk) MOV(0,Device[5].InterlockID) ];]]>
