<Comment>
<![CDATA[VF201 Interlock ID Priority — Assigns the highest-priority active interlock: VFD Communications 20, VFD Fault 21, VFD Not Ready 22. E-stop ID 10 is handled separately and has highest priority.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(EstopActive)[XIC(VF201.VFDCommsIntlk) MOV(20,Device[6].InterlockID) ,XIO(VF201.VFDCommsIntlk) XIC(VF201.VFDFaultIntlk) MOV(21,Device[6].InterlockID) ,XIO(VF201.VFDCommsIntlk) XIO(VF201.VFDFaultIntlk) MOV(0,Device[6].InterlockID) ];]]>
