<Comment>
<![CDATA[SC1 Interlock ID Priority — Assigns the highest-priority active interlock: VFD Communications 20, VFD Fault 21,E-stop ID 10 is handled separately and has highest priority.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(EstopActive)[XIC(SC1.VFDCommsIntlk) MOV(20,Device[12].InterlockID) ,XIO(SC1.VFDCommsIntlk) XIC(SC1.VFDFaultIntlk) MOV(21,Device[12].InterlockID) ,XIO(SC1.VFDCommsIntlk) XIO(SC1.VFDFaultIntlk) MOV(0,Device[12].InterlockID) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
